# Dev-only: secret for /api/dev/playwright-session (Playwright MCP login).
# High-entropy value (e.g. `openssl rand -hex 24`). Set in local .env.local ONLY.
# Do NOT set in Vercel Preview — the route is reachable there and this secret is
# its only barrier. See docs/codebase-conventions/dev-auth-route.md.
DEV_LOGIN_SECRET=
